  "title": "Helping workers retire with confidence: MetLife expands access to lifetime income through strategic collaboration with Alight",
  "summary": "Amid the decline of traditional pensions and ongoing market volatility, MetLife, Inc. (NYSE: MET) and Alight, Inc. (NYSE: ALIT) have announced a strategic collaboration to bring MetLife’s institutional income annuities to the Alight Worklife® platform, which serves nearly 12 million defined contribution (DC) plan participants.",
